    "name": "Ryobi ONE+ 18V Hybrid WhisperSeries 7-1/2 in. Fan",
    "category": "18V Tool Battery or AC, Quiet, Compact",
    "badge": "Best Overall",
    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "Runs on any Ryobi ONE+ 18V battery, the largest consumer tool platform",
