          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. The Seven Picks</a>
          <a href="#comparison" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Comparison Table</a>
          <a href="#runtime" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Runtime vs Battery Size</a>
          <a href="#tool-platforms" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Tool-Battery Platforms</a>
          <a href="#usb-c" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Built-In Batteries and USB-C</a>
          <a href="#power-station" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Box Fan on a Power Station</a>
          <a href="#outages" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Fans in a Summer Outage</a>
